(footprint "Jack_3.5mm_QingPu_WQP-PJ398SM_Vertical_CircularHoles"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "QingPu WQP-PJ398SM 3.5 mm TRS jack - the Thonkiconn - vertical, PCB mount. Land pattern is KiCad's stock Connector_Audio footprint unchanged, and it is the accurate one: terminals at S 0, TN 3.10, T 11.40, which is exactly the datasheet's -4.92 / +3.38 / +6.48 about the barrel axis. Prefer it over the sibling Thonkiconn_PJ301M in this library, whose 3.00 / 11.50 spacing is rounded and whose 1.1 drills are tighter than the 1.22-1.43 these terminals want. THE ONLY REASON THIS COPY EXISTS is the 3D model: KiCad ships no model for this jack at all - Connector_Audio.3dshapes contains four jacks and none of them is this one - so the stock footprint's model path resolves to nothing and the part renders invisible. This copy points at the Thonkiconn STEP vendored in 3d/. Do not 'fix' a project back to the stock footprint or the jacks disappear from the 3D view again.")
	(tags "jack 3.5mm trs thonkiconn qingpu pj398sm pj301m vertical eurorack")
